"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">36</div><h1>화법조동사의 추측 용법</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Modalverben zur Vermutung</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 36의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>B2 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">화법조동사가 주어의 일인지 말하는 사람의 추측인지 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">확신의 정도에 맞게 muss·müsste·dürfte·kann·könnte·kann nicht를 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">sollen으로 들은 말을, wollen으로 본인의 주장을 전해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">지난 일의 추측을 화법조동사 + 과거분사 + haben/sein으로 말해요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Mia hat heute schon zehnmal gegähnt. Sie muss sehr müde sein. — 이 muss의 뜻은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) 피곤하대요(소문)</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) 피곤해야 한다(의무)</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) 피곤한 게 틀림없다(추측)</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) 피곤해도 된다(허가)</button></div><div class=\"qe\">하품을 계속한다는 근거로 말하는 사람이 판단해요 → 추측의 muss.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Ich muss heute Abend noch meine Bewerbung schreiben. — 이 muss의 뜻은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) 써야 한다(의무)</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) 쓸 수 있다(능력)</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) 썼대요(소문)</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) 쓴 게 틀림없다(추측)</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주어(ich)가 해야 하는 일이에요 → 의무의 muss(10과).</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;muss&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Überall auf der Straße sind Pfützen. Es <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(müssen)</span> in der Nacht geregnet haben.</div><div class=\"qko\">길 곳곳에 물웅덩이가 있어요. 밤에 비가 온 게 틀림없어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Überall auf der Straße sind Pfützen. Es <b>muss</b> in der Nacht geregnet haben.</div>근거가 분명한 추측 → muss. 지난 일이라서 끝에 과거분사 + haben을 둬요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;müsste&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Frag doch Jonas, er <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(müssen · 기대)</span> die Antwort wissen. Er ist schließlich Informatiker.</div><div class=\"qko\">요나스에게 물어봐요. 그는 답을 알 거예요(그래야 정상이에요). 어쨌든 IT 전문가잖아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Frag doch Jonas, er <b>müsste</b> die Antwort wissen. Er ist schließlich Informatiker.</div>'그래야 정상이다'라는 기대 → müsste.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Reparatur dürfte nicht viel kosten.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">수리비는 아마 많이 들지 않을 거예요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">dürfte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Reparatur</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">viel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">kosten.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Reparatur dürfte nicht viel kosten.</b></div>'아마'의 추측 → dürfte. 화법조동사는 두 번째, 원형 kosten은 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;kann&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Frau Lang <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(können)</span> nicht im Urlaub sein. Ich habe sie doch heute Morgen beim Bäcker gesehen.</div><div class=\"qko\">랑 씨가 휴가 중일 리가 없어요. 오늘 아침에 빵집에서 그녀를 봤거든요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Frau Lang <b>kann</b> nicht im Urlaub sein. Ich habe sie doch heute Morgen beim Bäcker gesehen.</div>'~⁠일 리가 없다' → kann nicht.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> '그 호텔은 아주 시끄럽대요.' (인터넷 후기에서 읽음)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Das Hotel muss sehr laut sein.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Das Hotel darf sehr laut sein.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Das Hotel soll sehr laut sein.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Das Hotel will sehr laut sein.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">남들이 하는 말을 전할 때 → sollen.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;will&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Der Junge <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> die Vase nicht kaputt gemacht haben. Aber wer war es dann?</div><div class=\"qko\">그 남자아이는 자기가 꽃병을 깨지 않았다고 주장해요. 그럼 누가 그랬을까요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Junge <b>will</b> die Vase nicht kaputt gemacht haben. Aber wer war es dann?</div>주어 자신의 주장(말하는 사람은 의심함) → wollen. 주장의 wollen은 주로 지난 일에 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;vergessen&quot;],[&quot;haben&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Mein Schlüssel ist weg. Ich muss ihn im Taxi <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(vergessen)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">열쇠가 없어요. 택시에 두고 내린 게 틀림없어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mein Schlüssel ist weg. Ich muss ihn im Taxi <b>vergessen</b> <b>haben</b>.</div>지난 일의 추측 → muss + 과거분사 + haben. vergessen의 과거분사는 원형과 모양이 같아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gefahren&quot;],[&quot;sein&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Im ganzen Haus ist es dunkel. Die Nachbarn müssen schon in den Urlaub <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(fahren)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">집 전체가 깜깜해요. 이웃들이 벌써 휴가를 떠난 게 틀림없어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Im ganzen Haus ist es dunkel. Die Nachbarn müssen schon in den Urlaub <b>gefahren</b> <b>sein</b>.</div>fahren은 현재완료에서 sein을 써요 → gefahren sein.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Sie dürfte schon zu Hause sein. = Sie ist <span class=\"qblank\"></span> schon zu Hause.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) kaum</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) bestimmt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) wahrscheinlich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) sicher nicht</button></div><div class=\"qe\">dürfte는 '아마' → wahrscheinlich.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Er ist bestimmt beim Training. = Er <span class=\"qblank\"></span> beim Training sein.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) muss</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) könnte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) soll</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) kann nicht</button></div><div class=\"qe\">bestimmt(틀림없이)는 muss와 같은 정도예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;musste&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> '그는 어제 밤늦게까지 일해야 했어요.'<br>Er <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(müssen)</span> gestern bis spät in die Nacht arbeiten.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 어제 밤늦게까지 일해야 했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · '그는 어제 밤늦게까지 일해야 했어요.'<br>Er <b>musste</b> gestern bis spät in die Nacht arbeiten.</div>과거의 의무 → 과거형 musste + 원형.<br>muss + gearbeitet haben이면 '일한 게 틀림없다'는 추측이 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;muss&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Was teuer ist, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(müssen)</span> nicht unbedingt gut sein.</div><div class=\"qko\">비싼 것이 꼭 좋은 건 아니에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Was teuer ist, <b>muss</b> nicht unbedingt gut sein.</div>muss nicht = '꼭 ~⁠인 것은 아니다'예요. kann nicht(~⁠일 리 없다)와 구별해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Das Paket müsste morgen bei dir ankommen.&quot;,&quot;Morgen müsste das Paket bei dir ankommen.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">소포는 내일 너한테 도착할 거예요(그래야 정상이에요).</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">morgen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">dir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Paket</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">ankommen.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">bei</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">müsste</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Das Paket müsste morgen bei dir ankommen.</b></div>기대 → müsste. 분리동사 ankommen은 원형 그대로 맨 끝에 놓아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> Der Zeuge <span class=\"qblank\"></span> den Täter genau gesehen haben, sagt die Polizei. 경찰 말로는 증인이 범인을 정확히 봤대요</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) will</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) soll</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) muss</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) dürfte</button></div><div class=\"qe\">경찰(다른 사람)의 말을 전해요 → sollen.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> 확신이 가장 약한 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Er dürfte recht haben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Er muss recht haben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Er könnte recht haben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Er hat bestimmt recht.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">확신의 순서는 muss·bestimmt &gt; dürfte &gt; könnte예요. könnte가 가장 조심스러워요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;soll&quot;],[&quot;sein&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Der Sänger <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> letzte Woche heimlich in Seoul gewesen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 가수가 지난주에 몰래 서울에 왔었대요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Sänger <b>soll</b> letzte Woche heimlich in Seoul gewesen <b>sein</b>.</div>소문 → sollen. 지난 일이고 sein의 과거분사는 gewesen, 보조 동사도 sein이에요 → gewesen sein.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> 뜻이 '그녀는 그 편지를 받은 게 틀림없어요'인 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Sie musste den Brief bekommen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Sie hat den Brief bekommen müssen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Sie soll den Brief bekommen haben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Sie muss den Brief bekommen haben.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">추측은 지금 → muss(현재형), 지난 일 → bekommen haben.<br>musste·hat … müssen은 과거의 의무, soll은 소문이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;kann&quot;],[&quot;haben&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Tim <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> das Geld nicht genommen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">. Er war den ganzen Nachmittag bei mir.</div><div class=\"qko\">팀이 그 돈을 가져갔을 리가 없어요. 오후 내내 저랑 같이 있었거든요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Tim <b>kann</b> das Geld nicht genommen <b>haben</b>. Er war den ganzen Nachmittag bei mir.</div>'~⁠였을 리 없다' → kann nicht + 과거분사 + haben.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Unsere Lehrerin dürfte Anfang fünfzig sein.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 선생님은 아마 50대 초반일 거예요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Lehrerin</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">sein.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Anfang</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">fünfzig</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">dürfte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Unsere</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Unsere Lehrerin dürfte Anfang fünfzig sein.</b></div>'아마' → dürfte. 원형 sein이 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;könnte&quot;,&quot;kann&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Laura antwortet nicht auf meine Nachrichten. Sie <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> noch im Kino sein, aber ich bin nicht sicher.</div><div class=\"qko\">라우라가 제 메시지에 답이 없어요. 아직 영화관에 있을 수도 있지만 확실하지는 않아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Laura antwortet nicht auf meine Nachrichten. Sie <b>könnte</b> noch im Kino sein, aber ich bin nicht sicher.</div>확실하지 않은 가능성 → könnte 또는 kann. könnte가 더 조심스러워요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Mein Kollege <span class=\"qblank\"></span> das ganze Buch an einem Wochenende gelesen haben — das glaube ich ihm nicht.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) will</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) dürfte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) muss</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) soll</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주어 자신이 그렇게 주장하고, 말하는 사람은 믿지 않아요 → wollen.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;dürfte&quot;,&quot;wird&quot;],[&quot;haben&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> Sie hat ihr ganzes Geld wahrscheinlich schon ausgegeben.<br>= Sie <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> ihr ganzes Geld schon ausgegeben <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 아마 돈을 벌써 다 써 버렸을 거예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Sie hat ihr ganzes Geld wahrscheinlich schon ausgegeben.<br>= Sie <b>dürfte</b> ihr ganzes Geld schon ausgegeben <b>haben</b>.</div>wahrscheinlich(아마) → dürfte, 지난 일 → ausgegeben haben.<br>26과의 미래완료 wird … haben도 같은 정도의 추측이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Er dürfte die Nachricht inzwischen gelesen haben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Der Hund muss aus dem Garten gelaufen haben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Sie kann gestern unmöglich in Hamburg gewesen sein.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Sie soll als Kind in Kanada gelebt haben.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">laufen은 이동이라 현재완료에서 sein을 써요 → gelaufen sein.<br>나머지는 모두 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;soll&quot;],[&quot;will&quot;],[&quot;könnte&quot;,&quot;kann&quot;],[&quot;kann&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Ein Wolf <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> in der Nähe des Dorfes gesehen worden sein, schreibt die Zeitung. Ein Bauer <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> ihn sogar fotografiert haben, aber er zeigt das Foto niemandem. Es <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> also auch ein großer Hund gewesen sein. Ein echter Wolf <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"> hier eigentlich nicht leben, denn der nächste Wald ist 100 Kilometer entfernt.</div><div class=\"qko\">신문에 따르면 마을 근처에서 늑대가 목격됐대요. 한 농부는 늑대 사진까지 찍었다고 주장하지만 아무에게도 사진을 보여 주지 않아요. 그러니 큰 개였을 수도 있어요. 진짜 늑대가 사실 여기 살 리는 없어요, 가장 가까운 숲이 100킬로미터 떨어져 있거든요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ein Wolf <b>soll</b> in der Nähe des Dorfes gesehen worden sein, schreibt die Zeitung. Ein Bauer <b>will</b> ihn sogar fotografiert haben, aber er zeigt das Foto niemandem. Es <b>könnte</b> also auch ein großer Hund gewesen sein. Ein echter Wolf <b>kann</b> hier eigentlich nicht leben, denn der nächste Wald ist 100 Kilometer entfernt.</div>신문의 말 → soll · 농부 자신의 주장(의심스러움) → will · 가능성 → könnte/kann · ~⁠일 리 없다 → kann nicht.<br>gesehen worden sein은 수동태의 완료 부정형이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Serie soll schon in vielen Ländern gezeigt worden sein.&quot;,&quot;In vielen Ländern soll die Serie schon gezeigt worden sein.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 드라마 시리즈는 이미 여러 나라에서 방영됐대요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">schon</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">sein.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">in</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">vielen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">worden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">soll</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Ländern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">gezeigt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">Serie</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Serie soll schon in vielen Ländern gezeigt worden sein.</b></div>소문 → soll. 수동태 현재완료(ist gezeigt worden)를 끝에 놓으면 gezeigt worden sein이 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Man erzählt, dass der Koch früher in Paris gearbeitet hat. — 같은 뜻은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Der Koch soll früher in Paris gearbeitet haben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Der Koch will früher in Paris gearbeitet haben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Der Koch sollte früher in Paris arbeiten.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Der Koch muss früher in Paris gearbeitet haben.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">사람들이 하는 말(man erzählt) → soll + 과거분사 + haben.<br>sollte + 원형은 '일해야 했다', will은 요리사 본인의 주장이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;muss&quot;],[&quot;gebacken&quot;],[&quot;haben&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> Ich bin sicher, dass sie den Kuchen selbst gebacken hat.<br>→ Sie <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> den Kuchen selbst <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(backen)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀가 케이크를 직접 구운 게 틀림없어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich bin sicher, dass sie den Kuchen selbst gebacken hat.<br>→ Sie <b>muss</b> den Kuchen selbst <b>gebacken</b> <b>haben</b>.</div>ich bin sicher → muss. 지난 일이라서 끝에 과거분사 gebacken + haben을 놓아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> '그녀는 그때 아마 겨우 열여덟 살이었을 거예요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Sie darf damals erst achtzehn gewesen sein.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Sie durfte damals erst achtzehn sein.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Sie dürfte damals erst achtzehn gewesen sein.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Sie dürfte damals erst achtzehn sein gewesen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">추측의 dürfen은 늘 dürfte예요. 지난 일 → gewesen sein(과거분사 → sein 순서).<br>durfte는 과거의 허가, darf는 추측에 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"